id: chrome-padlock
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: The padlock on an https page: a tap asks the daemon for the page's certificate and the card shows it
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://example.com/
kit: cavekit-ui-shell.md R8
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:p' 60
calibrate 'sel:p'
sample page 0,100,756,960
chrome padlock
wait line 'luna: pageCertificate' 8
wait differs 0,100,756,960 page 5
shoot padlock
